  "details": "I use quest 3 handtracking, it looks janky with avatar gestures turned on, so I keep them turned off, but I also want to turn them on occasionally to use my props. But currently due to the gesture lock design I cannot get my smooth handtracking back without turning off avatar gestures and rejoining the world. It would be nice if there was a way to turn off avatar gestures and then release the gesture lock so I can get the handtracking back without those extra steps.",
